    "description": "A KHN state-variable active filter: a summing amplifier plus two integrators produce simultaneous low-pass, band-pass, and high-pass outputs from one input (fc≈1.585kHz, Q≈5). Run an AC sweep (dec) — LP rolls off at −40dB/dec above fc, HP rises at +40dB/dec below fc, and BP peaks at fc. (Validated on ngspice.)",
